XFollowing is a description of the contents of each column:
X
XLvl  - This column contains the level of the monster.  Level determines items
X       the monster's hit points, how many experience points it's worth, etc.
XSpd  - This is the monster's speed.  Compare this with your standard
X       character's speed of 10.
XAC   - This is the monster's armor class.  The lower this is, the harder it
X       will be to hit the monster.
XMR   - This is the magic resistance of the monster, and it is the percentage
X       chance that any spell hitting the monster has of failing.
XAln  - This is the monster's alignment.  C = Chaotic, N = Neutral, and
X       L = Lawful
XWgt  - This is the weight of the monster.  Consequently, it is also the
X       weight of any corpse the monster may leave.
XNutr - This is the nutritional value that can be gained from the monster's
X       corpse, if eaten.
XSiz  - This is the size of the monster, as may be used to compute weapon
X       damage.  S is smaller than human size, and L is larger than human size. 
